Full legal text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

The records are compiled from two public listings, the MACTE accredited program search
(https://www.macte.org/accredited-programs/) and the AMI list of training centres
(https://montessori-ami.org/training-programmes/training-centres). The licence covers our compilation,
cleaning and added columns. Program names, programs' own websites and the MACTE and AMI marks belong
to their owners. The code in scripts/ is released under the MIT License.
